{"detail": {"templateUuid": "e9d76880408b45bf961e1330815582bb", "projectUuid": "a8764561874146ca96ddf73b387761e4", "name": "千眼渡", "description": "本作品为古装古风剧情MV，全片采用AI全流程制作完成。以明代鄱阳湖千眼桥修建为历史背景，围绕岸医沈砚与水乡女医阿菱的双线故事展开，借古桥建造的时代脉络，串联人情、仁心与含蓄情愫。\n       整体采用中式古风美学设计，画面色调清冷温润，贴合明代水乡质朴质感，镜头节奏舒缓抒情，适配古风MV氛围。场景高度还原滨湖滩涂、古建工地与临时义诊摊等实景细节，服饰造型贴合明代平民与医者装束，强化时代代入感。\n       故事以千眼桥“夏沉湖、冬现桥”的自然奇观为底蕴，借筑桥见人心，以二人含蓄相守的感情线，暗喻两岸本是同根同源，山水相隔挡不住人心相通，寄托了对山河相依、两岸同心的美好期许。", "coverUrl": "/assets/f7b134e738d354b1.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/719c795bd59d412f894adc0416e9c1fe/41eab2be705bfd6f2392b939369a7dc0689b0bda.mp4", "snapshotId": 40112, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 8555350, "ownerUuid": "719c795bd59d412f894adc0416e9c1fe", "avatar": "/assets/36f804f91adbed4e.webp", "nickname": "九霖", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 50, "tags": [{"id": 1204, "code": "mv", "tagLabel": "MV", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1204/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "16 【用AI制作的文旅MV《千眼渡》 - 电影刺客 | 小红书 - 你的生活兴趣社区】 😆 5fFXcZw6hvrBTTl 😆 https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6a8bd77f0000000033029945?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=YBr9rSklD3Oe4cQohIQL2QVuNHNVuxqrkXH5nndIkQqJU=&xsec_source=pc_share", "createAt": "2026年08月24日 13:48", "updateAt": "2026年08月27日 19:30", "publishAt": "2026年08月24日 13:48", "playCount": 162, "viewCreationProcessCount": 74, "copyCanvasCount": 17, "shareCount": 2, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/e9d76880408b45bf961e1330815582bb.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 456, "edges": 528}}, "recommendL